@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title UC01 提交借书请求顺序图
actor "读者" as R
boundary BorrowUI as UI
control BorrowController as C
entity BookCopy as Copy
entity BorrowRecord as Loan
entity ReservationSlip as Slip
entity ReservationRecord as Queue
R -> UI : submitBorrow(readerId, bookId)
UI -> C : submitBorrow(readerId, bookId)
C -> C : 校验读者权限和书目存在
alt 校验不通过
 C --> UI : 返回输入或权限错误
else 输入有效
 C -> Copy : queryAvailable(bookId)
 Copy --> C : availableNum
 group 原子事务 T1
 C -> Copy : allocateOne(bookId)
 Copy --> C : copyId 或 null
 alt 成功分配可用复本
  note right of Copy : AVAILABLE -> RESERVED
  C -> Loan : createPending(readerId, bookId, copyId, null)
  Loan --> C : borrowId
  C --> UI : 返回待借出借阅记录
 else 无可分配复本
  C -> Slip : createWaiting(readerId, bookId)
  Slip --> C : slipId
  C -> Queue : create(slipId)
  C --> UI : 返回预约单与预约记录
 end
 end
end
UI --> R : 展示处理结果
note over C,Copy
queryAvailable 仅用于查询；以 allocateOne 的原子结果为准。
T1 创建失败则回滚复本状态，不留下孤立占用。
end note
@enduml
